Tree Traversal Example

       15                  ← Root Node
       /  \
      /    \
     3      6              ← Children of 15
    / \      \
   2   4      7           ← Children of 3 and 6
  /
 1                         ← Left child of 2



Traversal Orders
----------------------------------------------------------------------
| Traversal Type | Order Rule              | Result (Node Values)    |
|----------------|-------------------------|-------------------------|
| Inorder        | LEFT → ROOT → RIGHT     | 1, 2, 3, 4, 15, 6, 7    |
| Preorder       | ROOT → LEFT → RIGHT     | 15, 3, 2, 1, 4, 6, 7    |
| Postorder      | LEFT → RIGHT → ROOT     | 1, 2, 4, 3, 7, 6, 15    |
